@defgroup micro-os-plus-utils-lists-double-lists Doubly Linked Lists
@ingroup micro-os-plus-utils-lists-cpp-api
@brief Doubly linked lists classes.

@details
Traditional doubly linked or low-intrusive doubly linked lists are provided for use cases
where a fully intrusive approach is not required. These classes and templates offer a
straightforward way to manage collections of objects using the classic doubly linked list
structure.

For simpler use cases, such as traditional lists or low-intrusive lists,
there are several simpler classes and templates available.
